# File: tests/bdd/features/finalize.feature, tests/unit/pipeline/**, tests/blender/test_finalize_core.py, tests/e2e/test_finalize_e2e.py
# Generated from: specs/69-reshape-the-pipeline-to-finalize-an-authored-asset-instead-of-generating-from-a-prompt/requirements.md
Feature: Finalize an authored asset

  @SCN001
  Scenario: Finalize runs the six steps from an authored collection
    Given a collection "Crate" of class "standard_prop" in category "Props"
    When finalize runs
    Then the steps validate, bake, variants, export, reimport, and import_ue run in that order
    And the result lists each step and the UE content paths under /Game/Props/Crate/

  @SCN002
  Scenario: Long steps run in background Blender and load back
    Given an open Blender session holding "Crate"
    When finalize runs from an agent session
    Then each Blender step runs headless against the checkpoint and reports pollable progress
    And the baked Crate and Crate_Mobile collections replace the session's copies
    And a crashed background step fails with "finalize.job_crashed" and leaves the session unchanged

  @SCN003
  Scenario: A single step runs through the same implementation
    Given an authoring session holding "Crate"
    When the agent calls run_finalize_step with step "validate" and wait_seconds 60
    Then it receives a result with step "validate", cache_hit, outputs, and summary

  @SCN004
  Scenario: An unchanged finalized asset is served from cache
    Given "Crate" was finalized and loaded back
    When finalize runs again without changes
    Then every step reports cache_hit true and nothing is reimported into UE
    And after a material change the bake step and every later step run again

  @SCN005
  Scenario: The UE import completes the materials
    Given exported Desktop and Mobile folders for "Crate"
    When the import_ue step runs against UE 5.8
    Then /Game/Props/Crate/Desktop and /Game/Props/Crate/Mobile hold assets with identical names
    And T_Crate_Body_N has Flip Green Channel set and MI_Crate_Body sets BaseColor, Normal, and ORM on M_NmgORM
    And each child part keeps its pivot within 0.01 cm

  @SCN006
  Scenario: A failing step stops the run before UE import
    Given "Crate" fails contract validation
    When finalize runs
    Then it raises PipelineError "quality.contract_failed" with a remediation
    And no later step runs and nothing is imported into UE

  @SCN007
  Scenario: Steering describes freeform authoring plus finalize
    Given the steering product, tech, and structure snippets
    When they are scanned
    Then none contains "new-prop", "new-character", "generate_mesh", or a prompt-to-asset journey
    And the tech snippet names the finalize job runner, MCP tools, and CLI
